{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants","id":1498688,"title":"Could you build the Addams family as revenants?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-03T10:55:35-08:00","id":1498688,"title":"Could you build the Addams family as revenants?","content":"I mean Wednesday\u2019s family from Wednesday the new Netflix show.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8753-molly\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8753\" data-vbnamecard=\"8753\">Molly</a> do you have any opinion on this? Just wondering \ud83d\ude42. You would defo like Wednesday if you haven\u2019t seen it already.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":26996,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","user":"Amethyst","date":". 12-04-2022, 03:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T12:01:55-08:00","id":1498692,"title":"","content":"Celerity and Auspex as Disciplines, a social penalty as &quot;clan&quot; weakness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T13:25:53-08:00","id":1498700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants?p=1498692#post1498692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Celerity and Auspex as Disciplines, a social penalty as &amp;quot;clan&amp;quot; weakness.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-04T10:13:56-08:00","id":1498777,"title":"","content":"The Addams Family has always been one of my inspirations for Revenants along with movies like The Texas Chainsaw Massacre, the Hills Have Eyes, and the Burbs along with many others. Obviously there is not real horror in the Addams Family, but useful in the sense of people who appear human but act very differently and don't appear entirely sane. It would not be hard to keep the essentials of the characters in the Addams Family and use them for real horror, not comedy. <br /> <br /> If I was going to map an ersatz version of them to an existing family, I'd make them Obertus. They are not quite normal appearing enough to be Grimaldi, but lack the traits that distinguish the Bratovitch and Zantosa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-04T10:36:01-08:00","id":1498779,"title":"","content":"I don't think so. Some members of the Addams family are very good with people at times, and their flaws are very different: Wednesday has pretty dead emotions but Morticia is close to normal, Gomez is sometimes too emotive. Fester and cousin IT have appearance related maladies. Morbid interests and an aversion to whatever's popular are really the only thing they all share. Of course, the Adams family have been around for the better part of a hundred years so there's lots of different ways to interpret them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-04T12:15:08-08:00","id":1498780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants?p=1498777#post1498777\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Addams Family has always been one of my inspirations for Revenants along with movies like The Texas Chainsaw Massacre, the Hills Have Eyes, and the Burbs along with many others. Obviously there is not real horror in the Addams Family, but useful in the sense of people who appear human but act very differently and don't appear entirely sane. It would not be hard to keep the essentials of the characters in the Addams Family and use them for real horror, not comedy. <br /> <br /> If I was going to map an ersatz version of them to an existing family, I'd make them Obertus. They are not quite normal appearing enough to be Grimaldi, but lack the traits that distinguish the Bratovitch and Zantosa.</div> </div> </div> </div>The new Netflix show Wednesday is more of a drama than a comedy. And Obertus definitely works.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-04T13:15:59-08:00","id":1498791,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants?p=1498780#post1498780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The new Netflix show Wednesday is more of a drama than a comedy</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, but it's hard to take the Addams Family outside of their broader context with comics, cartoons, series and the Sonnenfeld flicks, it's hard to just consider one interpretation.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-10T11:38:34-08:00","id":1499301,"title":"","content":"Speaking of which. Have any you gamers have tried to create your own Revenants in your games?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T06:55:42-08:00","id":1499365,"title":"","content":"My take is the Addams Family are, in WoD terms, low insanity Marauders. Their break from reality is that they\u2019re normal while everyone else is weird and they all have varying degrees of Entropy that account for both why nothing too serious ever happens to them while those seek to harm them suffer improbably ignominious fates. Thing is their familiar who has no problem with Paradox inside their shared reality bubble. Fester\u2019s electricity is either Forces or a permanent paradox flaw resulting from using too much Entropy to get out of taking lightning damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T16:12:58-08:00","id":1499406,"title":"","content":"The Addams Family make perfect revenants and if you took all that they have done over the years and played it seriously instead of for humor, then they would be incredibly dark and twisted. Kids trying to kill each other, casual talk of murder, pouring boiling oil on Christmas carolers, implied incest, etc. If I was going to use a preexisting revenant family, I would agree with others that Obertus might be the best. If I were going to make the Addams revenant family, I think that I would give them Fortitude as one of their family Disciplines (since they always seem to be able to resist harm) and Thaumaturgy since witchcraft seems very common in the family and it also possibly explain other miscellaneous powers (like Uncle Fester and electricity). I\u2019m not sure what the third Discipline should be. Fester seems to have Potence (he lifted Tully with one hand and turned him upside down, no normal human could do that) and Gomez\u2019 acrobatic abilities during his sword fight suggests Celerity. <br /> <br /> I\u2019m not sure what the weakness could be. Some Addams lack social skills, but not all do. Some are ugly, but most aren\u2019t. Maybe each family members gets a derangement and that explains the various quirks that each family member seems to have. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants?p=1499301#post1499301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of which. Have any you gamers have tried to create your own Revenants in your games?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have made a number of revenant families and developed a number of the canon ones in greater detail. A few years back another guy and I developed an alternative WoD where Revenants were a major supernatural factions and had their own organizations and we tweaked and developed the families in more detail.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T16:41:45-08:00","id":1499410,"title":"","content":"That sounds like a fun passion project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T16:48:15-08:00","id":1499411,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amethyst</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants#post1498688\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean Wednesday\u2019s family from Wednesday the new Netflix show.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8753-molly\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"8753\" data-vbnamecard=\"8753\">Molly</a> do you have any opinion on this? Just wondering \ud83d\ude42. You would defo like Wednesday if you haven\u2019t seen it already.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, you could, I just don't know why you'd want to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-11T20:29:06-08:00","id":1499417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants?p=1499410#post1499410\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That sounds like a fun passion project.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is. I never got a chance to run a game in that setting, though I\u2019d like to finish fleshing it out and maybe play a game in the setting some day. <br /> <br /> Basically, vampires disappeared centuries ago and revenant families essentially took their place. There were several major factions - The Genos (created by the Tzimisce), the Onorata Societ\u00e0 (created by the Giovanni), and the Black Hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-12T04:41:40-08:00","id":1499429,"title":"","content":"I once explained revenants as &quot;Adams family but not funny.&quot; so yeah<br /> <br /> Clan-tzmisce<br /> <br /> Discipline-Fortitude, auspex animalism<br /> <br /> Flaw- the Adams are either oblivious to social ques or are fundemently unwilling to react appropriately often appearing morbid, blunt, nonchalant about horror but also strangely naive. +2 difficulties to empathy rolls.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-12T08:50:17-08:00","id":1499446,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1498688-could-you-build-the-addams-family-as-revenants?p=1499429#post1499429\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I once explained revenants as &quot;Adams family but not funny.&quot; so yeah<br /> <br /> Clan-tzmisce<br /> <br /> Discipline-Fortitude, auspex animalism<br /> <br /> Flaw- the Adams are either oblivious to social ques or are fundemently unwilling to react appropriately often appearing morbid, blunt, nonchalant about horror but also stra